1
00:00:00,009 --> 00:00:03,679
(David:)This is an amazing woman, Leonard.
She has a curious and agile mind.

2
00:00:03,846 --> 00:00:06,766
(David:)Not to mention being curious and agile
in other respects.

3
00:00:07,183 --> 00:00:08,763
(Penny:)Shut up.

4
00:00:08,934 --> 00:00:11,274
(Leonard:)Yes, please, shut up.

5
00:00:12,646 --> 00:00:16,356
(Leonard:)So, um, Dave, don't you think
you and I should get back to the lab?

6
00:00:16,525 --> 00:00:19,865
(Leonard:)You know, that dark matter
isn't gonna detect itself.

7
00:00:22,907 --> 00:00:26,867
(David:)I was thinking about taking the afternoon
off so I could experiment with Penny.

8
00:00:27,369 --> 00:00:29,709
- Really? We're gonna do an experiment?
DAVID: Uh-huh.

9
00:00:29,872 --> 00:00:34,212
We're gonna explore the effects of tequila
shots on a gorgeous 22-year-old woman.

10
00:00:34,376 --> 00:00:37,546
That's not an experiment.
You saw what happened last night.

11
00:00:39,256 --> 00:00:40,546
DAVID: You ready to go?
- Yeah.

12
00:00:40,716 --> 00:00:43,096
(Penny:)- Oh, can I drive the motorcycle?
- Yeah, why not?

13
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:45,050
(David:)You can't do any worse than Leonard.

14
00:00:45,221 --> 00:00:47,931
- Oh, my God.
- No, that's good. That's funny.

15
00:00:50,559 --> 00:01:16,039
(Leonard:)By the way, my leg is killing me.
Thanks for asking.

